abstract: >-
  MMCCP v2.0 (Project ID: PW26_CGM_02, PES University, Dept. of CSE, Faculty Guide: Prof. Chitra G M)
  is a training-free character consistency pipeline for multi-panel storyboarding on consumer 8 GB VRAM GPUs,
  paired with a frozen SHA-256 deterministic verification suite (v1.2). No permissive OSI LICENSE file is shipped;
  standard copyright and institutional capstone policies apply to original source files, while third-party model
  weights carry upstream licenses documented in docs/run/LICENSES_AND_MODELS.md.

